#### a_tab_keeps_only_its_kind (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\ninl article = page.sample ()\ninl release = { article with slug = \"v3\"; kind = page.Release }\nCons (article, Cons (release, Nil)) |> only page.Release |> listm.length |> _assert_eq 1i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  inl article = page.sample ()
  inl release = { article with slug = "v3"; kind = page.Release }
  Cons (article, Cons (release, Nil)) |> only page.Release |> listm.length |> _assert_eq 1i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
